1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,692
Two traps in this unit.

2
00:00:01,692 --> 00:00:04,986
First, every temperature formula here needs kelvin.

3
00:00:04,986 --> 00:00:07,578
Using Celsius gives nonsense.

4
00:00:07,578 --> 00:00:15,364
Second, the coefficient of performance is not an efficiency, so do not be alarmed when it comes out bigger than one.

